  <item>
    <title>No.49 放下“振兴”执念，拥抱自在东北</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6956804814db1df9efef4942</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6956804814db1df9efef4942</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 02 Jan 2026 06:08:54 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>又是一年冬天来临，东三省开始开门迎客。</span></p><span></span><p><span>无数南方人北上赏雪，感受东北文化。</span></p><span></span><p><span>女主播做为一个在东北意义里的南方人，去了东北游玩，感触颇多。</span></p><span></span><p><span>男主播做为一个土生土长的东北人，已经跑路到了杭州六年。</span></p><span></span><p><span>两个人坐在一起，开始聊一个宏伟的话题：东北振兴。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容大纲】</span></p><span></span><p><span>第一部分：为什么要聊东北</span></p><span></span><p><span>第二部分：东北经济漫谈，从太冷开始</span></p><span></span><p><span>第三部分：经济的铁律下，还要振兴东北吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>第四部分：怎么正确面对东北的状况</span></p><span></span><p><span>【参考资料】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E6%8C%AF%E5%85%B4%E4%B8%9C%E5%8C%97/7120207?fr=aladdin" data-url="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E6%8C%AF%E5%85%B4%E4%B8%9C%E5%8C%97/7120207?fr=aladdin"><span>百度百科-振兴东北</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E4%B8%9C%E5%8C%97%E5%85%A8%E9%9D%A2%E6%8C%AF%E5%85%B4/65386281#reference-6" data-url="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E4%B8%9C%E5%8C%97%E5%85%A8%E9%9D%A2%E6%8C%AF%E5%85%B4/65386281#reference-6"><span>百度百科-东北全面振兴</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ZBMRzWEYD" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ZBMRzWEYD"><span>半个俄罗斯的财富，都流向了这座滨海小城</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://v.douyin.com/DG8JQdwfkHE/" data-url="https://v.douyin.com/DG8JQdwfkHE/"><span>第290集 | 振兴东北</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://v.douyin.com/VBZNXeJqT8o/" data-url="https://v.douyin.com/VBZNXeJqT8o/"><span>东北三省为何留不住人？共和国长子的百年沉浮！</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://v.douyin.com/2XTzxefY4aE/" data-url="https://v.douyin.com/2XTzxefY4aE/"><span>第539集 | 阳和平：市场经济下农民重走集体路？没那种可能！</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://v.douyin.com/7pFCHj91ChQ/" data-url="https://v.douyin.com/7pFCHj91ChQ/"><span>第16集 | 东北还有救吗？ 有的有的，两大工程再造江浙沪！</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://v.douyin.com/3Uv7ETDQ9z0/" data-url="https://v.douyin.com/3Uv7ETDQ9z0/"><span>一场集出生率、离婚率、死亡率于一体的东北人口消失魔术</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://v.douyin.com/oADrg41ny4I/" data-url="https://v.douyin.com/oADrg41ny4I/"><span>一文读懂“东北振兴”的财富密码！何超琼落子东北文旅：跨境“时间差”激活冰雪经济新引擎！工业基因+AI革命：东北振兴的黎明时刻！</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1HZHMzwEtt/" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1HZHMzwEtt/"><span>东北的衰退，是一种“中国特色”吗？</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Bf4y1c7D7" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Bf4y1c7D7"><span>【睡前消息336】国庆闲聊，停电的东北本来就缺煤</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1aoPYemEPX/" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1aoPYemEPX/"><span>【睡前消息868】物流成本高，本溪编制大</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ga4y1L7of/" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ga4y1L7of/"><span>骁话一下：东北复兴，出路不在歌声里</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1sY411t7d3/" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1sY411t7d3/"><span>【温伯陵】东北为什么会衰落？</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV12EJizyETc/" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV12EJizyETc/"><span>东北资源枯竭报告：为啥东北模式是最惨的？【地球知识局】</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1uu4y1G7xP/" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1uu4y1G7xP/"><span>振兴东北口号喊了快20年，这些年东北有何变化，发展变好了吗？</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/festival/city?bvid=BV1PG4y1Z7Mx" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/festival/city?bvid=BV1PG4y1Z7Mx"><span>东北的崛起，没有技巧，东北的衰落，全是感情</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1yf4y17749/" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1yf4y17749/"><span>【36氪】全国都是东北人，为啥东北没有人？</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV17qfuY1EiW/" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV17qfuY1EiW/"><span>2025地方转移支付排名，感谢长三角珠三角的富哥们</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1sH4y1K7s8" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1sH4y1K7s8"><span>【参考信息第240期】转移支付龙虎榜；大众书局卡爆雷</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Wt421E7ES/" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Wt421E7ES/"><span>全国转移支付突破十万亿！中部地区为何一直都输麻了？</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1jnfkYiERq" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1jnfkYiERq"><span>中央与地方博弈的根本逻辑，不懂财税就不懂中国经济</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1CcwVeqEHE/" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1CcwVeqEHE/"><span>一口气了解化债和中国的财政体系</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1eP411c77F/" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1eP411c77F/"><span>祖上阔过三次的东北，钱都去哪了？</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1YW4y1A742/" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1YW4y1A742/"><span>曾经富过的东北三省，为何如今这么穷？他们的钱都花哪去了？</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1di42117rz/" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1di42117rz/"><span>新闻联播-全面振兴东北</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="http://canr.neu.edu.cn/" data-url="http://canr.neu.edu.cn/"><span>中国东北振兴研究院</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1164y1A7mm/" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1164y1A7mm/"><span>东北著名经济学家巴俊宇：站在东北的视角思考和谋划东北的未来。——在辽宁省“振兴民营企业，促进辽宁经济高质量发展”大会上的演讲</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1qM1NBHE3F" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1qM1NBHE3F"><span>著名经济学家巴俊宇在沈阳第三届东北亚金融大会暨平行论坛金融赋能农业科技创新专题讨论会上的发言</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV18j411v78C/" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV18j411v78C/"><span>东北人峰哥锐评东北,二十分钟</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1br421A7WZ" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1br421A7WZ"><span>东北有望重获出海口？离解决这个问题还远着呢！</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>【制作人员】</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </s